# BuildKit reads this file (not a root .dockerignore) for
# containers/Dockerfile.cp2k-ml because it sits next to the Dockerfile and is
# named <Dockerfile>.dockerignore. The build context is the repository root, so
# the file is an allowlist: everything is excluded except what the Dockerfile
# COPYs. No CP2K source may enter the context; the cp2k-ml-scf fork is
# bind-mounted at run time.
*
!containers/scripts/validate_cp2k_ml_stack.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
